  "description": "The SKE Bar Prefilled Pod Kit provides a super-satisfying and convenient way to vape, combining a compact reusable device with the unmistakable crystalline design of the original, iconic SKE Crystal Bar disposable. Featuring a 500mAh rechargeable battery, mesh coil technology, all-in-one replaceable pod system, and inhale activation, the SKE Bar offers a smooth and consistent mouth-to-lung (MTL) vape experience in a pocket-friendly format. Each kit is supplied with a 2ml pod containing 20mg or 0mg nicotine salt e-liquid for a smoother throat hit and rapid relief from nicotine cravings. An innovative all-in-one replaceable pod system means the pod is integrated into the chassis, allowing for easy recycling once the pod is depleted, reducing waste. You just keep the battery component ready for your next prefilled SKE Bar Pod. The battery offers fast USB-C charging (cable sold separately) to minimise downtime. What's more, every kit contains a SKE Chip that optimises flavour and vapour with every puff, regardless of how charged your battery is. The SKE Bar's durable build and colourful, crystal-clear finish make it an ideal choice for new and experienced vapers looking for ultimate simplicity, incredible flavour and effortless portability. SKE BAR Prefilled Pod Kit Flavours • Lemon and Lime • Cherry Ice • Fresh Menthol Mojito • Watermelon Ice • Blueberry Sour Raspberry • Blue Razz Lemonade • Pink Lemonade • Cola Ice • Watermelon Strawberry • Sour Pineapple Ice • Strawberry Burst • Blueberry Raspberries • Kiwi Passion Fruit Guava • Berry Ice • Fizzy Cherry • Menthol • Blue Fusion • Banana Ice • Peach Ice • Strawberry Kiwi • Blueberry Cherry Cranberry • VMT Ice • Pineapple Peach Mango • Strawberry Blast • Fruit Medley • Gami Rare • Bull Ice • Tobacco • Green Grape • Strawberry Raspberry • Sour Apple Ice • Apple Peach • Lemon Peach Passion Fruit • Mango Ice • Blueberry Peach Ice Please Note: This kit does NOT come with a USB-C cable Shop SKE Bar Refill Pods",
